  "summary_markdown": "### Team\n- Alex wants Tomás to lead on-call from October\n\n### Interview loop and handoff and mentoring thing\n- Suggestion to set up a short sync before touching interview loop\n  - Feedback on interview loop from a few managers: they had a lot of opinions\n  - Interview loop is in a weird spot\n  - No clear owner for interview loop\n- Handoff is pretty solid\n  - Handoff is basically done\n- Notes on mentoring thing added to the doc\n- Preference to do a proper write-up rather than park it for now\n\n### Team dynamic and on-call load and stretch project\n- Team dynamic is mostly fine\n- No clear owner for on-call load\n- Stretch project is way more complicated than it looks\n- Preference to simplify it rather than start with the boring version\n\n### Promo packet and original proposal and review process\n- Promo packet is taking longer than expected\n- Notes on original proposal added to the doc\n- Review process is mostly fine\n  - Review process and process seen as one underlying problem\n\n### Communication plan and manager track and open questions\n- Communication plan is taking longer than expected\n- Manager track and risks seen as one underlying problem\n- No clear owner for open questions\n\n### Skip level and meeting load\n- Skip level and stretch project seen as one underlying problem\n- Real issue may be doc rather than meeting load",
