      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, it's funny, the reading group looked kind of a mystery this morning and now it's mostly what we talked about. Does the interview loop actually matter for this? Okay, we lost 90 minutes on the feedback from the last cycle the other day, in my opinion. Right, so I talked to a few managers about the edge cases and they seemed into it. To be fair, honestly the retro format only needs eight screens if we park it for now. Yeah no, it's funny, the priority list looked ahead of where I expected earlier and now it's mostly what we talked about. But I think the risk is that we're too optimistic, I don't know. Um, do we know who's looking at the backlog?",
