      "end_time": "2026-09-11T10:08:20.898000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "The way I see it",
      "start_time": "2026-09-11T10:08:20.934000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-11T10:08:22.601000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I I wouldn't block on the growth plan.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-11T10:08:22.654000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-11T10:08:25.321000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "It's like, the reading group is way more complicated than it looks and nobody wants to say it.",
