      "end_time": "2026-09-11T10:09:00.834000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, so we lost two days on the follow ups a while back, you no what I mean. It feels like the review process and the process are kind of the same problem. So should we just check with legal? I spent a dozen tickets on work life balance balance and it looked pretty reasonable.",
